recipe|silver-helm|failure_actor => <ansi fg="red">The silver tears as you work it. The metal is wasted.</ansi>
recipe|silver-ring|success_actor => <ansi fg="green">You shape the silver into a gleaming band and fuse gem dust along the edge. A silver ring!</ansi>
recipe|silver-ring|failure_actor => <ansi fg="red">The silver warps under uneven pressure and the band buckles. The materials are ruined.</ansi>
