recipe|thornguard|failure_actor => <ansi fg="red">The catalyst rejects the binding. The materials crumble to dust, but the shield is unharmed.</ansi>
recipe|toxic-flask|success_actor => <ansi fg="green">The venom dissolves into a sickly green cloud inside the sealed flask. A toxic flask!</ansi>
recipe|toxic-flask|failure_actor => <ansi fg="red">The venom crystallizes uselessly. The materials are wasted.</ansi>
recipe|trail-rations|success_actor => <ansi fg="green">You salt the meat and dry it over the fire. Trail rations!</ansi>
recipe|trail-rations|failure_actor => <ansi fg="red">The meat chars to a blackened lump. The materials are lost.</ansi>
