recipe|venison-jerky|failure_actor => <ansi fg="red">The strips burn before they dry.</ansi>
recipe|venomgrip|success_actor => <ansi fg="green">Venom seeps from the settings into the glove leather, hardening into chitin across the knuckles. Your grip tightens with newfound strength.</ansi>
recipe|venomgrip|failure_actor => <ansi fg="red">The catalyst rejects the binding. The materials crumble to dust, but the gloves are unharmed.</ansi>
recipe|voice-amber-housing|success_actor => <ansi fg="green">You facet the amber deep and hollow a cradle in its warm center. A voice-amber housing!</ansi>
recipe|voice-amber-housing|failure_actor => <ansi fg="red">The amber fractures along a hidden seam. The materials are wasted.</ansi>
recipe|warriors-brew|success_actor => <ansi fg="green">The herbs fuse into a rust-colored brew that radiates warmth. A warrior's brew!</ansi>
recipe|warriors-brew|failure_actor => <ansi fg="red">The mixture thickens and burns. The materials are wasted.</ansi>
recipe|whittle-shafts|success_actor => <ansi fg="green">You whittle the branches straight and round. Arrow shafts!</ansi>
recipe|whittle-shafts|failure_actor => <ansi fg="red">Your knife slips and the shafts come out crooked.</ansi>
recipe|whittling-knife|success_actor => <ansi fg="green">You forge a short, stiff blade with a fine point and set it in a wooden handle. A whittling knife!</ansi>
recipe|whittling-knife|failure_actor => <ansi fg="red">The point snaps off in the grinding. The materials are lost.</ansi>
recipe|windlace-bindings|success_actor => <ansi fg="green">You bind bark and setting into cord too fine to trust with the eye, leaning it a half-beat ahead of the step. Windlace bindings!</ansi>
recipe|windlace-bindings|failure_actor => <ansi fg="red">The binding snaps taut and unravels before the enchantment can catch. The materials are wasted.</ansi>
recipe|windrunner-draught|success_actor => <ansi fg="green">The brew effervesces as the last ingredient settles. A windrunner draught!</ansi>
recipe|windrunner-draught|failure_actor => <ansi fg="red">The mixture fizzes violently and evaporates. The materials are wasted.</ansi>
recipe|wolf-fur-cloak|success_actor => <ansi fg="green">You scrape and salt the pelts and stitch them fur-in into a heavy cloak. A wolf-fur cloak!</ansi>
recipe|wolf-fur-cloak|failure_actor => <ansi fg="red">The pelts were not cured enough and the seams split. They are ruined.</ansi>
recipe|woodcutters-axe|success_actor => <ansi fg="green">You forge a single-bit axe head, punch the eye, and hang it on a long haft. A woodcutter's axe!</ansi>
recipe|woodcutters-axe|failure_actor => <ansi fg="red">The eye splits as you drift it open. The head is scrap.</ansi>
recipe|wooden-chest|success_actor => <ansi fg="green">You dovetail the planks, fit a lid and hang it on iron hinges. A wooden chest!</ansi>
recipe|wooden-chest|failure_actor => <ansi fg="red">The joints will not close square. The wood is wasted.</ansi>
recipe|wooden-club|success_actor => <ansi fg="green">You glue up the planks, shape a heavy head and a narrow grip, and wrap the handle in leather. A wooden club!</ansi>
recipe|wooden-club|failure_actor => <ansi fg="red">The glue line splits as you shape the head. The wood is wasted.</ansi>
recipe|wooden-shield|success_actor => <ansi fg="green">You glue up the planks, cut them round and fit a leather strap. A wooden shield!</ansi>
recipe|wooden-shield|failure_actor => <ansi fg="red">The planks spring apart. The shield is ruined.</ansi>
recipe|woodworking-bench|success_actor => <ansi fg="green">You build a heavy bench, fit an iron vise and a tool rack. A woodworking bench!</ansi>
recipe|woodworking-bench|failure_actor => <ansi fg="red">The top will not lie flat. The materials are wasted.</ansi>
recipe|wool-cloak|success_actor => <ansi fg="green">You layer the cloth and stitch a broad cloak with a bone toggle clasp. A wool cloak!</ansi>
recipe|wool-cloak|failure_actor => <ansi fg="red">The heavy fabric bunches and the stitching fails. The materials are ruined.</ansi>
